  "referenceNumber": "RUS1890",
  "remarks": "\n JSC NPP KLASS develops and produces body armour which it supplies to the armed forces of the Russian Federation. JSC NPP KLASS is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions)(EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because it is or has been obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by carrying on business in a sector of strategic importance to the Government of Russia, namely the defence sector.\n",
